reference.api:
```
POST /v1/receipts          {asn, lines[{sku, qty}]}
POST /v1/putaway/scan      {tote, bin, sku, qty, scan_id}
POST /v1/waves/release     {order_ids[] | rule}
POST /v1/workers/{id}/next-task   → {task_id, bin, sku, qty, lease_until}
POST /v1/tasks/{id}/scan   {bin, sku, qty, scan_id}   → ok | short_pick
POST /v1/tasks/{id}/complete
```
- Handhelds pull their next task; every scan has a `scan_id` for dedupe.
